{"id":"c2a1966286db10df","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-greedyprime.md","title":"Greedy extraction of a prime support from an oracle-positive set","display":"thm-greedyprime — Greedy extraction of a prime support from an oracle-positive set","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-greedyprime","aliases":["27-thm-greedyprime"],"display":"thm-greedyprime — Greedy extraction of a prime support from an oracle-positive set","depends_on":["[[27-df-minmaxsupport]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§10.6 algorithm part A; Exercise 16","source_printed_pages":"474,483","source_pdf_pages":"498,507","verification_status":"source-algorithm-and-local-invariant-proof-checked","local_review_status":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-greedyprime"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-greedyprime</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-greedyprime — Greedy extraction of a prime support from an oracle-positive set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a38b86e606184c7f\" href=\"?note=a38b86e606184c7f\" title=\"27-df-minmaxsupport\">27-df-minmaxsupport</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§10.6 algorithm part A; Exercise 16"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"474,483"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"498,507"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-algorithm-and-local-invariant-proof-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq[n]\">\\(U\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" href=\"?note=640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" title=\"27-df-monotone\">27-df-monotone</a>；特征向量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_S\">\\(\\chi_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M(f)\">\\(\\mathcal M(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a38b86e606184c7f\" href=\"?note=a38b86e606184c7f\" title=\"27-df-minmaxsupport\">27-df-minmaxsupport</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0,\\ldots,S_n\">\\(S_0,\\ldots,S_n\\)</span> 由下式递归构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_0\\coloneqq U,\\qquad\nS_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nS_{i-1}\\setminus\\{i\\}&amp;i\\in S_{i-1}\\land f(\\chi_{S_{i-1}\\setminus\\{i\\}})=1,\\\\\nS_{i-1}&amp;i\\notin S_{i-1}\\lor f(\\chi_{S_{i-1}\\setminus\\{i\\}})=0\n\\end{cases}\\quad(i\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_0\\coloneqq U,\\qquad\nS_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nS_{i-1}\\setminus\\{i\\}&amp;i\\in S_{i-1}\\land f(\\chi_{S_{i-1}\\setminus\\{i\\}})=1,\\\\\nS_{i-1}&amp;i\\notin S_{i-1}\\lor f(\\chi_{S_{i-1}\\setminus\\{i\\}})=0\n\\end{cases}\\quad(i\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f(\\chi_U)=1\\Rightarrow S_n\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\land S_n\\subseteq U.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f(\\chi_U)=1\\Rightarrow S_n\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\land S_n\\subseteq U.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f(\\chi_U)=0\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists A\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\;(A\\subseteq U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f(\\chi_U)=0\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists A\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\;(A\\subseteq U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §10.6 part A、Exercise 16，印刷 pp.474,483／PDF pp.498,507。初始为真时每步保持真；某坐标删除曾失败，后续继续缩小集合只会保持那次删除后的假值，故终态每位不可删。固定扫描顺序，有限递归单值。先检验U，再至多对U每个元素查询一次，共至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|U|+1\">\\(|U|+1\\)</span> 次；f恒1返回空支持，恒0正确报告无支持。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-minmaxsupport","status":"resolved","id":"a38b86e606184c7f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-minmaxsupport]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-monotone","status":"resolved","id":"640eb8f2fbffd9d9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$，$U\\subseteq[n]$；$\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ 见 [[27-df-monotone]]；特征向量 $\\chi_S$ 与 $\\mathcal M(f)$ 见 [[27-df-minmaxsupport]]。$S_0,\\ldots,S_n$ 由下式递归构造。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-minmaxsupport","status":"resolved","id":"a38b86e606184c7f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$，$U\\subseteq[n]$；$\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ 见 [[27-df-monotone]]；特征向量 $\\chi_S$ 与 $\\mathcal M(f)$ 见 [[27-df-minmaxsupport]]。$S_0,\\ldots,S_n$ 由下式递归构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n","display":false},{"tex":"U\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Monotone}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M(f)","display":false},{"tex":"S_0,\\ldots,S_n","display":false},{"tex":"S_0\\coloneqq U,\\qquad\nS_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nS_{i-1}\\setminus\\{i\\}&i\\in S_{i-1}\\land f(\\chi_{S_{i-1}\\setminus\\{i\\}})=1,\\\\\nS_{i-1}&i\\notin S_{i-1}\\lor f(\\chi_{S_{i-1}\\setminus\\{i\\}})=0\n\\end{cases}\\quad(i\\in[n]).","display":true},{"tex":"f(\\chi_U)=1\\Rightarrow S_n\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\land S_n\\subseteq U.","display":true},{"tex":"f(\\chi_U)=0\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists A\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\;(A\\subseteq U).","display":true},{"tex":"|U|+1","display":false}],"bytes":1897,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-greedyprime|thm-greedyprime — Greedy extraction of a prime support from an oracle-positive set]]"}],"outgoing":["a38b86e606184c7f","640eb8f2fbffd9d9"]}